((date 2026-09-13) (slug stop-width-12pct-weekly-confirmation-grid)
 (hypothesis
  "Promotion confirmation grid (promotion-confirmation.md) for the 12% initial stop x weekly trail cadence candidate that earned a single-surface ACCEPT on the 26y record cell (2026-09-13-stop-width-12pct-weekly-cadence-v10dedup). Two independent broad 5y cells on different PIT composition vintages - top-3000-2009 (2009-01-02..2013-12-31) and top-3000-2019 (2019-01-02..2023-12-29), both _v10dedup warehouses - each at three salts, paired against that vintage's own record-convention null. The 26y cell is the bear-regime cell. Pre-registered per-cell rule = the 26y rule: realised P&L AND maxDD both better at >= 2 of 3 salts; the grid clears only if all three cells clear.")
 (base_scenario
  "cadence-12w-v10-2026-09-13: specs n5-<vintage> (a0-breadth-on-null moved to the vintage's period/universe, entry_order_max_rest_weeks pinned 0) and a4-<vintage> (n5 + initial_stop_buffer 0.9167 + stop_update_cadence Weekly); chain-grid.sh lanes G1/G2 on the pinned worktree sweep-detgate @ 31e4bb9c3. Pairing gate validator_diff -check V6: exit 0 on every 2019 pair; exit 1 on all three 2009 pairs (V6 = 1 on the arm only: CMD/CMN 2009-10-10 rename twin, +$9.6k duplicated, read ex-twin). All twelve cells complete (lanes done 17:55 PT).")
 (window_id top3000-2009-and-2019-5y-3salt-grid) (baseline_label record-convention-null-per-vintage)
